    {
      "index": 1,
      "sceneId": "scene_01",
      "type": "story",
      "durationSeconds": 13.4,
      "camera": {
        "motion": "slow_zoom_in"
      },
      "visual": {
        "imagePath": "assets/scene_01.png",
        "status": "ready"
      },
      "audio": {
        "text": "Hari ini adalah Hari Cukur Rambut Tahunan bagi Sringeri Srinivas. Rambutnya sudah sangat panjang dan lebat. Seperti biasa, ia berangkat menuju tukang cukur desa.",
        "audioPath": "assets/id/scene_01.mp3",
        "wordsPath": "assets/id/scene_01_words.json",
        "en": {
          "text": "It was the Annual Haircut Day for Sringeri Srinivas. Sringeri Srinivas left home as usual to go to the local barber.",
          "audioPath": "assets/en/scene_01.mp3",
          "wordsPath": "assets/en/scene_01_words.json",
          "durationSeconds": 9.3,
          "status": "ready"
        },
        "status": "ready",
        "sfxPath": "assets/sfx/sfx_01_morning_walk.m4a",
        "sfxVolume": 0.26
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "sceneId": "scene_02",
      "type": "story",
      "durationSeconds": 8.1,
      "camera": {
        "motion": "pan_right"
      },
      "visual": {
        "imagePath": "assets/scene_02.png",
        "status": "ready"
      },
      "audio": {
        "text": "Tetapi tukang cukur berkata, \"Aduh, hari ini aku tidak punya waktu untuk memotong rambut sepanjang itu!\"",
        "audioPath": "assets/id/scene_02.mp3",
        "wordsPath": "assets/id/scene_02_words.json",
        "en": {
          "text": "But the barber said, \"Today, I have no time to cut such long hair!\"",
          "audioPath": "assets/en/scene_02.mp3",
          "wordsPath": "assets/en/scene_02_words.json",
          "durationSeconds": 5.5,
          "status": "ready"
        },
        "status": "ready",
        "sfxPath": "assets/sfx/sfx_02_scissors.m4a",
        "sfxVolume": 0.26
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "sceneId": "scene_03",
      "type": "story",
      "durationSeconds": 14.6,
      "camera": {
        "motion": "slow_zoom_in"
      },
      "visual": {
        "imagePath": "assets/scene_03.png",
        "status": "ready"
      },
      "audio": {
        "text": "Dengan hati sedih, Sringeri Srinivas pulang ke rumah untuk meminta tolong istrinya. Tetapi sang istri berkata, \"Aduh, hari ini aku sibuk memasak, tidak sempat memotong rambut sepanjang itu!\"",
        "audioPath": "assets/id/scene_03.mp3",
        "wordsPath": "assets/id/scene_03_words.json",
        "en": {
          "text": "Feeling sad, Sringeri Srinivas went back home to ask his wife for help. But his wife said, \"Today, I have no time to cut such long hair!\"",
          "audioPath": "assets/en/scene_03.mp3",
          "wordsPath": "assets/en/scene_03_words.json",
          "durationSeconds": 11.3,
          "status": "ready"
        },
        "status": "ready",
        "sfxPath": "assets/sfx/sfx_03_kitchen.m4a",
        "sfxVolume": 0.26
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "sceneId": "scene_04",
      "type": "story",
      "durationSeconds": 16.3,
      "camera": {
        "motion": "pan_right"
      },
      "visual": {
        "imagePath": "assets/scene_04.png",
        "status": "ready"
      },
      "audio": {
        "text": "Mulai agak kesal, Sringeri Srinivas pergi menemui sahabatnya, si penjahit. Tetapi tukang jahit berkata, \"Aduh, jahitanku menumpuk! Hari ini aku tidak punya waktu memotong rambut sepanjang itu!\"",
        "audioPath": "assets/id/scene_04.mp3",
        "wordsPath": "assets/id/scene_04_words.json",
        "en": {
          "text": "Feeling a little angry, Sringeri Srinivas went to his friend, the tailor. But the tailor said, \"Today, I have no time to cut such long hair!\"",
          "audioPath": "assets/en/scene_04.mp3",
          "wordsPath": "assets/en/scene_04_words.json",
          "durationSeconds": 11.3,
          "status": "ready"
        },
        "status": "ready",
        "sfxPath": "assets/sfx/sfx_04_tailor.m4a",
        "sfxVolume": 0.26
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "sceneId": "scene_05",
      "type": "story",
      "durationSeconds": 17.1,
      "camera": {
        "motion": "slow_zoom_in"
      },
      "visual": {
        "imagePath": "assets/scene_05.png",
        "status": "ready"
      },
      "audio": {
        "text": "Sekarang mulai cemas, Sringeri Srinivas pergi menemui sahabatnya yang lain, si tukang kayu. Tetapi tukang kayu berkata, \"Aduh, kayuku masih banyak! Hari ini aku tidak punya waktu memotong rambut sepanjang itu!\"",
        "audioPath": "assets/id/scene_05.mp3",
        "wordsPath": "assets/id/scene_05_words.json",
        "en": {
          "text": "Now a little worried, Sringeri Srinivas went to one more friend, the carpenter. But the carpenter said, \"Today, I have no time to cut such long hair!\"",
          "audioPath": "assets/en/scene_05.mp3",
          "wordsPath": "assets/en/scene_05_words.json",
          "durationSeconds": 11.7,
          "status": "ready"
        },
        "status": "ready",
        "sfxPath": "assets/sfx/sfx_05_carpenter.m4a",
        "sfxVolume": 0.26
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "sceneId": "scene_06",
      "type": "story",
      "durationSeconds": 15.4,
      "camera": {
        "motion": "pan_right"
      },
      "atmosphere": {
        "weather": "leaves",
        "intensity": "medium"
      },
      "visual": {
        "imagePath": "assets/scene_06.png",
        "status": "ready"
      },
      "audio": {
        "text": "Kasihan sekali Sringeri Srinivas. Rasanya tidak ada satu pun orang yang mau memotong rambutnya di Hari Cukur Rambut ini. Sambil meneteskan air mata, ia berjalan sendirian melewati hutan desa.",
        "audioPath": "assets/id/scene_06.mp3",
        "wordsPath": "assets/id/scene_06_words.json",
        "en": {
          "text": "Poor Sringeri Srinivas. It seemed no one would cut his hair on this Annual Haircut Day. In tears, he walked off by himself past the village forest.",
          "audioPath": "assets/en/scene_06.mp3",
          "wordsPath": "assets/en/scene_06_words.json",
          "durationSeconds": 12.4,
          "status": "ready"
        },
        "status": "ready",
        "sfxPath": "assets/sfx/sfx_06_forest_leaves.m4a",
        "sfxVolume": 0.26
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "sceneId": "scene_07",
      "type": "story",
      "durationSeconds": 13.9,
      "camera": {
        "motion": "slow_zoom_in"
      },
      "atmosphere": {
        "weather": "rain",
        "intensity": "light"
      },
      "visual": {
        "imagePath": "assets/scene_07.png",
        "status": "ready"
      },
      "audio": {
        "text": "Ia duduk di dekat sebuah gua batu dan menangis tersedu-sedu: \"Hari sudah hampir sore... Bagaimana aku bisa menepati janjiku untuk potong rambut? Ya Tuhan, tolonglah aku!\"",
        "audioPath": "assets/id/scene_07.mp3",
        "wordsPath": "assets/id/scene_07_words.json",
        "en": {
          "text": "He sat near a cave and cried loudly: \"The day is nearly over. How can I keep my promise to cut my hair? Oh God, help me!\"",
          "audioPath": "assets/en/scene_07.mp3",
          "wordsPath": "assets/en/scene_07_words.json",
          "durationSeconds": 10.6,
          "status": "ready"
        },
        "status": "ready",
        "sfxPath": "assets/sfx/sfx_07_cave_rain.m4a",
        "sfxVolume": 0.26
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "sceneId": "scene_08",
      "type": "story",
      "durationSeconds": 15.4,
      "camera": {
        "motion": "slow_zoom_in"
      },
      "atmosphere": {
        "weather": "lightning",
        "intensity": "heavy"
      },
      "visual": {
        "imagePath": "assets/scene_08.png",
        "status": "ready"
      },
      "audio": {
        "text": "Seekor harimau yang sedang tidur nyenyak di dalam gua merasa sangat terganggu oleh suara tangisan itu. Harimau itu keluar sambil mengaum keras, mengayunkan cakar raksasanya ke arah Sringeri Srinivas! Auummm!",
        "audioPath": "assets/id/scene_08.mp3",
        "wordsPath": "assets/id/scene_08_words.json",
        "en": {
          "text": "The tiger sleeping peacefully inside the cave was very disturbed by all the noise. He came out, roaring, waving his giant paws at Sringeri Srinivas!",
          "audioPath": "assets/en/scene_08.mp3",
          "wordsPath": "assets/en/scene_08_words.json",
          "durationSeconds": 11.8,
          "status": "ready"
        },
        "status": "ready",
        "sfxPath": "assets/sfx/sfx_08_tiger_thunder.m4a",
        "sfxVolume": 0.26,
        "sfxDelaySeconds": 0.2
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "sceneId": "scene_09",
      "type": "story",
      "durationSeconds": 13.5,
      "camera": {
        "motion": "slow_zoom_in"
      },
      "visual": {
        "imagePath": "assets/scene_09.png",
        "status": "ready"
      },
      "audio": {
        "text": "Sringeri Srinivas begitu kaget dan ketakutan... Sangat takut, teramat takut, sampai-sampai... PLOP! Seluruh rambut di kepalanya rontok sekaligus!",
        "audioPath": "assets/id/scene_09.mp3",
        "wordsPath": "assets/id/scene_09_words.json",
        "en": {
          "text": "Poor Sringeri Srinivas was so scared, so scared, so scared that... all the hair fell off his head!",
          "audioPath": "assets/en/scene_09.mp3",
          "wordsPath": "assets/en/scene_09_words.json",
          "durationSeconds": 7.8,
          "status": "ready"
        },
        "status": "ready",
        "sfxPath": "assets/sfx/sfx_09_hair_pop.m4a",
        "sfxVolume": 0.26,
        "sfxDelaySeconds": 0.3
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "sceneId": "scene_10",
      "type": "story",
      "durationSeconds": 11.9,
      "camera": {
        "motion": "pan_right"
      },
      "visual": {
        "imagePath": "assets/scene_10.png",
        "status": "ready"
      },
      "audio": {
        "text": "Sambil memegang kepalanya yang botak licin, Sringeri Srinivas berlari secepat kilat kembali ke desa dengan wajah gembira! Harimau pun kembali tidur dengan tenang.",
        "audioPath": "assets/id/scene_10.mp3",
        "wordsPath": "assets/id/scene_10_words.json",
        "en": {
          "text": "Sringeri Srinivas ran all the way back to the village! The tiger went back to sleep.",
          "audioPath": "assets/en/scene_10.mp3",
          "wordsPath": "assets/en/scene_10_words.json",
          "durationSeconds": 7,
          "status": "ready"
        },
        "status": "ready",
        "sfxPath": "assets/sfx/sfx_10_running.m4a",
        "sfxVolume": 0.26
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "sceneId": "scene_11",
      "type": "story",
      "durationSeconds": 7.2,
      "camera": {
        "motion": "slow_zoom_in"
      },
      "visual": {
        "imagePath": "assets/scene_11.png",
        "status": "ready"
      },
      "audio": {
        "text": "Sekarang, Sringeri Srinivas tidak perlu potong rambut lagi untuk waktu yang sangat, sangat lama!",
        "audioPath": "assets/id/scene_11.mp3",
        "wordsPath": "assets/id/scene_11_words.json",
        "en": {
          "text": "Now, Sringeri Srinivas will not need a haircut for a very, very long time!",
          "audioPath": "assets/en/scene_11.mp3",
          "wordsPath": "assets/en/scene_11_words.json",
          "durationSeconds": 6.3,
          "status": "ready"
        },
        "status": "ready",
        "sfxPath": "assets/sfx/sfx_11_head_shine.m4a",
        "sfxVolume": 0.26
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "sceneId": "scene_12",
      "type": "moral",
