      "moral": {
        "headline": "Masalah Sulit Bisa Selesai dengan Cara Tak Terduga!",
        "headlineEn": "Big Worries Can Solve Themselves in Funny Ways!"
      },
      "audio": {
        "text": "Pesan moral cerita ini: Jangan pernah berputus asa saat menghadapi kesulitan! Terkadang hal yang paling tidak kita duga justru membawa jalan keluar terbaik dengan penuh tawa dan kebahagiaan!",
        "audioPath": "assets/id/scene_12.mp3",
        "wordsPath": "assets/id/scene_12_words.json",
        "en": {
          "text": "The moral of the story: Never give up when things don't go your way! Sometimes, life's biggest worries solve themselves in unexpected ways that bring us pure joy and laughter!",
          "audioPath": "assets/en/scene_12.mp3",
          "wordsPath": "assets/en/scene_12_words.json",
          "durationSeconds": 12.9,
          "status": "ready"
        },
